              <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5" /></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold leading-tight text-neutral-ink">Técnicos que<br />executam</span>
